Package: spainpolls
Title: R Client for the Spain Electoral Polls API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Spain Electoral Project", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "info@spainelectoralproject.com")
  )
Description: Provides a tidy R client for the public Spain Electoral Polls API.
    The package downloads elections, pollsters, parties, polls, poll results,
    and polling time series as typed tibbles for analysis with tidyverse tools.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/hmeleiro/spainpolls
BugReports: https://github.com/hmeleiro/spainpolls/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    lubridate,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    vctrs
